BashKitten OS — desktop customization within BashKitten.
New BashKitten code: AGPL-3.0-only. See licenses/AGPL-3.0.txt.

Retained and adapted source:
- Gnozzard, https://github.com/openresearchtools/gnozzard,
  59ca6d56ef147dea820381036838e76645074d0e: applications/installer/launcher
  behavior and dark/orange styling, GPL-3.0-or-later. Changes: native GTK/XFCE
  integration, backend-local naming, explicit X11 session, architecture validation,
  no arbitrary file quotas, private guest sudo/PTY instead of Polkit.
- Gnozzard orange folder artwork derives from GNOME Adwaita, LGPL-3.0-only.
  SVG attribution and upstream THIRD_PARTY.md are retained. Palette unchanged.
- PeGPU v0.1.106, aae5382fae02eaeb97ceeb7fcaa531f88009b081: scaling profiles,
  normalization, changed-value writes and transaction functions, MIT. Changes:
  shared settings, dynamic panel discovery, no process scraping or WM restart.
- BuzzardOS podman, 6c1b89f25c196ae7ab4a8f20e166b27e4ee94cc0:
  Thunar custom-action identities/merge behavior, AGPL-3.0-or-later.
- XFCE panel 4.20.8, 56211a5feb13158447c930c8de2b713a9256c1be:
  GPL-2.0-or-later, libxfce4panel LGPL-2.1-or-later. Only the per-window
  Two app mode action is patched; stock tasklist and systray implementations remain.
- Xfwm4 4.20.0, 7cadce33226be955fa2677b97a1969701d246b80:
  default decoration theme, GPL-2.0-or-later. Recolored to Gnozzard palette.
- BashKitten kitten-with-glasses logo, AGPL-3.0-only; original retained in
  browser/bashkitten/browser/branding/assets/bashkitten-logo-glasses-original.png.

Full pristine source, exact selected-file hashes and upstream paths are in
os/upstream/sources.json and os/upstream/. All modifications are in os/src,
os/data and os/patches; upstream snapshots remain unchanged. Matching source
is included in the repository source archive delivered beside release binaries.
Normal GTK, X11, XFCE, GLib, Python, AT-SPI and GIO dependencies remain native
OS packages; their own package/source metadata and copyright files remain installed.
No telemetry, external log collector, update checker or developer callback is
added. Source review/build checks are not a claim of completed traffic acceptance.

Termux tray menu dependency: libdbusmenu 16.04.0 official Launchpad release,
source SHA256 b9cc4a2acd74509435892823607d966d424bd9ad5d0b00938f27240a1bfa878a,
LGPL-2.1-or-later / LGPL-3.0-or-later component notices retained. GTK3 build is
private to BashKitten OS; Termux's GLib-only package is not substituted for it.
The named configure patch defines its Valgrind conditional when donor tests are
disabled; no donor tests or introspection/dumper tools enter the runtime package.

Private libxfce4windowing 4.20.7, e288652b65a103c64161307281116b838c5df643,
LGPL-2.1-or-later, from https://gitlab.xfce.org/xfce/libxfce4windowing.
Built for X11 only as the dependency required by panel 4.20.8; full source and
license texts retained. No separate Wayland/Sway desktop is included.
